== Verify against the root (as a host would)
$ nsh verify .nsh/out/com.example.nshstarter.remote-1.nshpkg --root .nsh/keys/root.pub
valid: com.example.nshstarter.remote 1.0.0 (build 1), release key 3ba2d79a65cea38d, sha256 8968f68297dce801338afb7f3accb0a634e04f85f2c10929c7b678565bb55d94, 0 assets, bytecode for this runtime

